{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_qanik_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_qanik_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"風雪代為傳達","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_qanik_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"511d4138b17ab39736252e166d76da80454cb2cb4a5e12f244ade0ba50dcffc3","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在一次冰原救援中，雪絨充當了部落和外人的橋樑。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......第幾天......了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......記不清了......五？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在看什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊......有一窩......羽獸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你還......有力氣......看......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"它們在......往下跳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......往下......跳......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"——嘭！\n遠處，一隻剛出殼沒多久的羽獸終於被冷風吹乾了絨毛，它睜開眼，看到自己身處懸崖上的巢穴。\n它的母親為了避開覓食的野獸，將巢穴築在這裡。\n但它如今也面對著一個問題：在學會飛翔之前，它只有躍下懸崖，才能覓得果腹的食物。\n它顫顫巍巍地邁出巢穴，張開脆弱的翅膀，試圖讓風撐起它的身體，隨後一躍而下——\n嘭！風吹來，它被吹翻，撞到懸崖的側面。\n嘭！它向下滾落，鋒利的冰淩劃破它的身軀。\n嘭！它摔落在雪地裡，冷硬的陳雪並沒能減少多少衝擊力，它遲緩地擺動著脖子，試圖站立起來，在被凍死之前回到母親身邊。\n它走過一具具兄弟姐妹的屍體，在它身後，又一隻羽獸邁出了腳步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）......重回懷抱，生養自然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們也看到了，占卜顯示這次救援的結果一片明朗......我們再努力一下，找到路，就能走出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嗎？現在風雪小了......咳，我們出發吧，留在這裡肯定會被凍死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，還有沒有有力氣的人可以和我一起先去找路？......等剩下的人休息好了，再跟著我們留下的記號過來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，占卜的結果已經預示......咳，我們不會有事的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不能在這裡守著這些壞了的定位機器......拜託了，相信我，在這裡繼續修它只會被凍死，我們要出去找路才行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g5_samitribe"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）你們在幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）停下！不許動主樹，再動我就動手了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"喔喔喔，他們在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，我只能聽懂“停下”，是這個水不能喝嗎？還是這個葉子不能摘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"但看他們的動作已經是在威脅了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"先放下，先放下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）不能拿走占卜的東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼意思？什麼意思？也不能放到地上嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）離開這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我聽不懂——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）等一下！別生氣！他們沒有惡意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）越來越多的外人來，我們不應該讓他們經過這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）可是他們帶來的那些東西也幫了我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）只是一點。病痛原本也是自然的一部分，我們也有能力解決......但外人不懂得尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）他們不知道占卜的東西不能動，不是不尊重主樹，是我還沒來得及告訴他們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）他們總是喜歡擅自做決定，你要教會他們，尊重我們，我們才會尊重他們，提供幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們不能動占卜的東西，它是從我們的主樹來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主樹是我們的家，下次你們想做什麼之前，請先問問我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......很嚴重嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外人把主樹的葉子丟在地上，就和你們眼中陌生人踩住家人的頭是一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會願意讓一個外面來的陌生人踩住你家人的頭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這棵樹是家......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，它哺育了我們的部落。我們一直生活在這裡，它給我們提供食物，提供住所......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們用它落下的枝椏占卜，得到指引。部落中的人不會允許從外面來的人擅自動它的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）真的假的......占卜不就是攤子上那些騙人的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）閉嘴吧你。事前學習你都學了什麼？他們明確說不能動的東西就別再糾纏下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）問都不行嗎？多瞭解一點對我們的研究也好啊......！看看這東西到底是怎麼指引他們的，有沒有什麼科學上的解釋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你了，呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"（不熟練的薩米語）雪絨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也只是來完成一些科研任務，也不希望和你們有更多的衝突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你告訴我們這些，如果還有別的需要注意的地方，也拜託先告訴我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......占卜用的東西也是部落中人們很在意的地方，不能隨便亂動。還有，如果你們要打獵的話，只能捕獵食用所需的數量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"野獸也是自然的一部分，你向自然索取，自然會哺育你。但如果索取得過多，自然也會討回多的那部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的是，你們不能捕殺任何一位母親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"探險者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。那......為了不要有不必要的誤會，能不能向你的族人傳達一下我們對剛剛做的事的歉意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）隊長，我告訴他們需要注意的事情了，他們說不會再有下次，他們很抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）他們馬上就要出發，我這就告訴他們應該往哪裡走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）如果每次來的外人都和他們一樣，或許部落中的那些人也不會反對得如此激烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）......希望他們能信守承諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）把這個給他們吧，要是在風雪中迷失了方向，可以把它向天空中射去。我們看到了，會去幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不要這麼沮喪......占卜已經預示了好結果，而且就是因為你們射出了那支箭，我才會找到你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不是射箭之前也不相信我們真的會看到它嗎？但我還是來了，占卜的結果也是一樣的，相信我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"定位的儀器都壞了，你們的占卜光說好結果......沒用啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，占卜不會出錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"那它能帶我們......找到路嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能......但我們也不能就這樣在這裡等著，出去肯定能有方向的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是來救你們的，我需要你們信任我，信任占卜的結果，相信我能把你們帶出去——這樣，你可以把手給我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們部落，離世的人們會被埋入冰雪，回歸自然......他們已經是冰原的一部分，自然原本就會保護我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"自然會保護我們......現在說這些有什麼用......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到了，就會相信我說的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉著我的手，然後只看著一片雪花，集中精神，閉上眼睛，你就能聽到——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"絮絮低語聲在雪絨的耳邊響起，他仔細分辨著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你就能聽到那些已經離開的人們低語的聲音。他們已經返回自然，和我們再次在一起了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘀嗒！一顆水珠從半空中突然地墜落。雪絨睜開眼，看著眼前歪倒著的幾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉住我的手，試試看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......能聽到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"聽到又能怎麼樣呢......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"試試看吧，這會讓你們覺得好受些的。或許這樣你們也會選擇相信我，放下這堆壞掉的機器，然後跟我一起去找路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"倖存者虛弱地抬起胳膊，拉住雪絨伸來的手，將信將疑地看向面前紛飛的雪花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧......那，怎麼知道要看......哪一片雪花？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當你選中它時，它會立馬開始融化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要把握，只有那麼幾秒的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......我看不清......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"靜下心來，你能看到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......吸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"narration","text":"<color=#000000>噓......簌簌，簌簌......</color>\n<color=#000000>獵物......跑......飛箭......嘩......</color>\n<color=#000000>呼......晶......集......</color>\n<color=#000000>帶回去......</color>\n<color=#000000>劈啪！......我們這回......劈啪！非常成功......</color>"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......到了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，喂？你們聽到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......“採集”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......“我們這回，非常成功”......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼，這是......尼克的聲音......！你也聽到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"是尼克剛剛說話了嗎？他不是......？"},{"type":"narration","text":"幾人遲疑地停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊......"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪絨指向遠處風雪中的一道冰隙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是聽到了他的聲音嗎？......看來他已經被冰原接納了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我還記得他，他是個，很好的研究者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）......重回懷抱......生養自然。"},{"type":"narration","text":"幾人沉默了一會兒，閉上雙眼，學著雪絨的樣子，不熟練地念起同樣的祈福詞句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）重回懷抱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）......生養自然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"那......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛說的占卜，它的結果......真的是我們能夠平安出去嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，每人朝我手中呼出一口熱氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找路的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把大家呼出的熱氣搓成一顆冰球，它會帶著我們找到正確的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我法杖上的繩結也是，出生那天每個人都會得到這個父母親手編織的繩結，不論在哪裡，它都會保護我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"然後呢......我就吹一口氣就好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後你們要做的就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信它，相信它會帶著我們找到正確的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）......感謝您......"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪絨從避風的洞穴站起身，將冰球向外滾去。\n他低聲念起祈禱的話語，施展源石技藝。\n冰球搖晃了幾下，開始滾動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，它已經在指路了，我們該出發了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我快走不動了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"裝備也掉到冰隙裡了，太危險了，不能再走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是來做科研，沒想著要送命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冰球還在指路......我們再堅持一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡停下很快就會被雪蓋住，跟在我後面......相信我好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家跟緊一點，冰球在融化......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請你們相信我，在它徹底融化之前，我們要找到路才行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......我看不到路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在打轉嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不信我們能靠這個冰球找到路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別......！"},{"type":"narration","text":"冰球在冰原上滾出一道淺淺的痕跡，隨後突然融化，化成了冰原上新一層的冰晶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失敗了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是所有人都相信冰球能夠指路，它支撐不了多久的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......又迷路了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們靠近一點！去背風的地方，不要在這裡停下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別再交談了，我們的體力應該用在走路上......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——蹲下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要鬆開繩索......蹲下，找到背風的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要鬆開繩索！......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈祥的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呦......你看他們把這裡弄的，人走了，火還沒有熄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抱怨的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的弓呢？我的靴子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抱怨的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"全都找不到了，難道他們把我的東西都收起來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抱怨的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"母親，我們的繩結不應該被懸掛在屋頂上留作紀念嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈祥的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小雪花是把它們都放到自己的法杖上了......嗯，我感覺到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈祥的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不知道小冰淩的腿還好嗎？不過他們的母親離我們越來越遠，看來這幾年都不會再來找我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抱怨的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不行，我要給這個家裡再留下來點什麼，起碼看起來像我來過......"},{"type":"narration","text":"一群羽獸撲扇著翅膀，飛進了窗戶。\n它們停在桌椅上，在架子上磨著尖尖的嘴和小爪，把碗碟翻過來玩，拉出擺放好的櫃架。\n它們打鬧著，屋中飄揚著它們掉落的羽毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再抱怨的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這還差不多嘛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我回來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......媽，我想吃你做的菜湯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉......怎麼覺得這麼好吃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我家不在這裡嗎？......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"該回家了......請送我回家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......回家......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈祥的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你真是欠打，把這裡弄得亂糟糟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再抱怨的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，可是之前那樣根本就看不出我在這裡生活過......這樣才有點我的痕跡嘛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊......誰在說話？"},{"type":"narration","text":"羽獸群被突然的出聲驚飛。羽獸們撲扇著翅膀，飛出窗外。大片大片的羽毛紛紛落下，遮住了雪絨的視線。\n透過紛亂的羽毛，他的視線逐漸清晰。\n叮鈴，鮮紅的繩結懸掛在冰原中一棵枯樹上，它垂下未編好的絲線，落在雪地上。\n雪地上層層疊疊的腳印延展開，像是另一棵橫向生長的大樹，繩結長在它的根旁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繩結","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪絨想起母親給他講的故事。\n一棵麻草如何從植物變成麻繩，如何被染上顏色，如何被她和父親編結，如何被掛到樹上，最終被穿過風雪的他拿在手中。\n繩結微微搖晃，雪絨低頭看自己手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我法杖上面的繩結，為什麼在這裡？"},{"type":"narration","text":"他踮起腳，摘下繩結，重新繫在自己的法杖上。\n雨水從天而降，滑過樹葉，落入沼澤。\n一塊晶石沉睡在沼澤中，雪絨低頭看去，沼澤表面淺淺的水紋映出他的臉，他的眼睛上蒙著一片輕軟的羽毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"晶石","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看不到自己的眼睛，但我知道，你和我的眼睛......長得很像？"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪絨伸手撈起那塊晶石，晶石裂成兩塊，一塊再次沉入水底，他把另一塊嵌到自己的法杖上。\n千萬片羽毛騰空而起，他終於什麼也看不見，只能聽到一點聲音。\n似乎是在家中，似乎是祖母和父親在小聲地抱怨，家中不再留存他們的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們是回來了嗎？那是不是就可以不用再走了？我這幾年去了外面好多地方，我特別想給你們講這些事的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在在一艘大船上工作，船上還有很多人，什麼國家的都有......父親，我還帶了您常做的那種食物給他們嚐嚐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這身衣服也是那艘船上的人們給我做的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這些繩索，他們幫我都做了一套新的，我把之前你們給我做的那套收起來了，就在這個箱子裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要好好保存起來，只在最重要的時候穿......"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪絨艱難地邁開步子，扶住眼睛上的羽毛，迷蒙中跨過腳下的所有枯枝、冰雪、泥沼，他伸手向前。\n他撲了個空，又彷彿是抱住了一捧溫暖的羽毛，他覺得自己暖洋洋的。\n繩結和晶石閃閃發亮，法杖似乎有話想說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈祥的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小雪花，法杖上的晶石是你媽媽為你嵌上去的，它是你的眼睛，還記得我當初是怎麼教你的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再抱怨的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它代表著你能夠看破風雪，找到要找的人、要找的終點。"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪絨緊攥著手，握緊了他的法杖。父親和祖母在風雪中出現了，祖母衝著他微笑，那麼溫柔，那麼慈祥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慈祥的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要是在冰原上看到一朵不會融化的雪花，那就是我。你要是看到天上飛過一隻永不落地的羽獸，那也是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再抱怨的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們會永遠在你身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再抱怨的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......重回懷抱，生養自然......感謝您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再抱怨的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......感謝您。"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪絨的嘴唇翕動著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......祖母，我小的時候你給我做的那個樹枝糖，是怎麼做的來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我好想那個味道......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g5_samitribe"},{"type":"narration","text":"寒風吹進部落，繩結與樹葉沙沙作響。\n部落中的人們停住步伐，側耳傾聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......風雪的聲音不一樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從冰原吹來的風總是會有起伏，風雪有它自己的決定，我們只需要跟隨它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是外來人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不會，外來者的聲音，風雪不會代為傳達。"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪花並沒有在注視下融化，它兀自飄飛，靜靜落在地面上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪花","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......風雪的聲音又變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是為了前幾天進入冰原的那些哥倫比亞人......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......之前從來沒有過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是冰原接受了他們？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們也聽到風雪聲了，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我給我兒子的那顆晶石“張開了眼”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都是救援隊的成員。出去這麼長時間未歸，他們有危險，我們要......快點去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我被埋在了雪下？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我得爬上去......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳......！我的晶石......在發光？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"40_g2_glacier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（就快看到上面了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（胳膊和腳動不了了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......沒力氣了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖母......"},{"type":"narration","text":"哢啦。\n雪層破碎的聲音在雪絨的頭頂響起。\n啊，就要在這裡結束了嗎？......被風雪掩埋，和父親一樣？難怪......剛剛夢到了父親和祖母......\n哢啦，哢啦。\n按照經驗，雪馬上就會死死壓住自己的頭，四肢會失去知覺，鼻子會被雪塞滿，自己會和冰原成為一體，成為風，成為雪。\n雪絨的思維在渙散，他好像又看到了那成團的溫柔羽毛，看到了祖母伸來的溫暖的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那個糖的問題......還沒有回答我呢......"},{"type":"narration","text":"哢啦！\n雪層破碎，雪絨沒能聽見，也沒能看見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"手！把手給我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小雪花？小雪花！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聽得到嗎？別睡過去，快！醒醒，把手給我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......祖母？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醒醒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我抓住你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......！母親？......你怎麼來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我感覺到了......你的眼睛！"},{"type":"narration","text":"母親從雪地中拽出雪絨，拽出他的法杖。法杖頂端，和雪絨瞳色相仿的晶石正閃閃發亮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳......！我剛剛......做了一個夢，我夢到了......父親和祖母......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"母親，你的身體......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風雪帶來了你們的聲音，不管怎麼樣......我都會救回我的孩子，還有其他母親的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......其他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在......在那邊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......謝謝你們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不是在做夢啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的聲音也被風雪送到了部落嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我們都聽到了。風雪代為傳達，帶來了你們每個人的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是冰原選擇了拯救你們。"},{"type":"narration","text":"一隻小羽獸飛來，在他們頭頂盤旋鳴叫，落下一根羽毛。\n部落中的人們拾起這根羽毛，閉眼默唸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）......感謝您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）重回懷抱，生養自然......感謝您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"雪絨，謝謝你，謝謝你們......救了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是占卜說的......好結果嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......我居然......活下來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，你們的主樹......接不接受我們的......呃，感謝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）他們......可以感謝主樹嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰原居民A (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）......嗯。冰原選擇了拯救你們，你們可以感謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......它會接受每個人的感謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）重回懷抱，生養自然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）......感謝您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小羽獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（鳴叫）"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪絨抬起頭，陽光在冰原上是耀眼的白色，沒有落雪，只有一根羽毛。\n它飄飄悠悠，落到了雪絨攤開的手掌上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪絨","speakerId":"avg_466_qanik_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩米語）感謝......您。"},{"type":"narration","text":"羽獸振翅，飛向了天空。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
